WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Chun-Li activates raw Drive Rush before the low starter.

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:01.500
Rush crouching light kick connects on the crouching Juri.

3
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.350
Standing light punch leads into standing medium punch.

4
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.150
Crouching medium punch connects before the charged ender.

5
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:04.700
Heavy Spinning Bird Kick completes the low conversion.

6
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:05.150
Juri recovers after the heavy-SBK ender.
